# Known CVEs that originate from the Spring Boot 2.0.3 / Spring Cloud Finchley
# baseline used throughout this repo. Fixing them requires upgrading the entire
# framework stack (Spring Boot 2.0.3 -> 2.7.x or 3.x and Spring Cloud
# Finchley -> Hoxton/2020.x/2021.x/2022.x), which is a separate, breaking
# change tracked outside of the dependency-vulnerability fix PR.
#
# Re-evaluate every entry below after the Spring Boot upgrade lands.

# Spring4Shell. Fixed in Spring Boot 2.5.12 / 2.6.6.
CVE-2022-22965

# Spring Boot Actuator authentication bypass. Fixed in Spring Boot 3.5.12 / 4.0.4.
CVE-2026-22733

# Spring Cloud Config Server path traversal via profile.
# Fixed in Spring Cloud Config 4.3.2 / 5.0.2.
CVE-2026-22739
